### Capability BC — 实时语音会话(客户端直连上游 + 按时长预扣)
###
### 对接文档: docs/api/live-session.md
### 实现:     internal/capability/port/http/live_session_handler.go
###           internal/capability/app/builtins/live_session_token/
###
### 计费模型: 签发时按 granted_minutes 预扣 → 通话结束上报真实用时 → 差额自动退回;
###           不上报则约 30 分钟后由兜底 worker 按预扣全额扣除。
###
### env 变量: see docs/api/http-requests/http-client.env.json
###   - {{base_url}}     e.g. http://localhost:8080
###   - {{access_token}} JWT
###   - {{app_id}} + {{app_signature}}  see cmd/signtool
###
### 前置(否则稳定返 50084):
###   1. cap_capabilities.metadata.live_model_version_bid 已配真实实时模型版本
###   2. 该模型版本的渠道是 Gemini Developer API(Vertex 后端无法签发临时令牌)
###   迁移: 20260804_cap_deferred_settlement_columns.sql → 20260804b_live_session_token_capability.sql

############################################
# 1. 开始会话 — 签发令牌(此刻预扣积分)
############################################

# @name startLiveSession
POST {{base_url}}/v1/live-sessions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
X-App-ID: {{app_id}}
X-App-Signature: {{app_signature}}

{
  "requested_minutes": 15
}

### 响应关注点:
###   execution_bid          → 必须保存, 结算要用
###   granted_minutes        → 实际授予(= 实际预扣), 可能小于请求值
###   new_session_expires_at → 必须在此之前发起上游连接(默认仅 60s)
###   expires_at             → 令牌总有效期; 临近时需先 settle 再重新签发

############################################
# 2. 缺省时长(取平台上限)
############################################

POST {{base_url}}/v1/live-sessions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
X-App-ID: {{app_id}}
X-App-Signature: {{app_signature}}

{}

############################################
# 3. 超限请求 — 应被钳制到上限而非报错
############################################

POST {{base_url}}/v1/live-sessions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
X-App-ID: {{app_id}}
X-App-Signature: {{app_signature}}

{
  "requested_minutes": 600
}

### 期望: 200 且 granted_minutes = 15(上游纯音频单会话硬限)

############################################
# 4. 非法入参 — 应 40033 且不产生冻结
############################################

POST {{base_url}}/v1/live-sessions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
X-App-ID: {{app_id}}
X-App-Signature: {{app_signature}}

{
  "requested_minutes": 0
}

############################################
# 5. 结算 — 上报真实用时(差额自动退回)
############################################

@executionBid = {{startLiveSession.response.body.data.execution_bid}}

POST {{base_url}}/v1/live-sessions/{{executionBid}}/settle
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
X-App-ID: {{app_id}}
X-App-Signature: {{app_signature}}

{
  "used_minutes": 4
}

### 期望: settled=true, cost_credits = 冻结额 × 4 / granted_minutes(向下取整)

############################################
# 6. 重复结算 — 幂等, 不二次扣费
############################################

POST {{base_url}}/v1/live-sessions/{{executionBid}}/settle
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
X-App-ID: {{app_id}}
X-App-Signature: {{app_signature}}

{
  "used_minutes": 4
}

### 期望: 200 且 settled=false(已结算), 钱包余额不再变化

############################################
# 7. 超报用量 — 应被钳制到已授予时长, 绝不超扣
############################################

POST {{base_url}}/v1/live-sessions/{{executionBid}}/settle
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
X-App-ID: {{app_id}}
X-App-Signature: {{app_signature}}

{
  "used_minutes": 9999
}

############################################
# 8. 越权结算 — 用他人账号的 JWT 结算, 应 40300
############################################

POST {{base_url}}/v1/live-sessions/{{executionBid}}/settle
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{other_access_token}}
X-App-ID: {{app_id}}
X-App-Signature: {{app_signature}}

{
  "used_minutes": 1
}

############################################
# 9. 核对账本 — 结算后钱包与冻结应自洽
############################################

GET {{base_url}}/v1/wallet
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
X-App-ID: {{app_id}}
X-App-Signature: {{app_signature}}

### 排障 SQL(服务端):
###   -- 挂起中的会话(status=running = 已签发未结算)
###   SELECT bid, invoker_account_id, estimated_credits, billable_quantity,
###          cost_credits, freeze_id, finished_at
###     FROM cap_executions
###    WHERE status = 'running'
###    ORDER BY finished_at;
###
###   -- 兜底 worker 会回收 finished_at 早于 (now - grace_period) 的行
###   -- grace_period 默认 30min, 见 config.capability.deferred_settlement
